{"unit_id": "tag:01T6:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是一个态射（morphism）。若<MATH_0002>是（局部）诺特（Noetherian）的，且<MATH_0003>是（局部）有限型（finite type）的，则<MATH_0004>是（局部）诺特（Noetherian）的。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "Noetherian", "target_term": "诺特"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}, {"source_term": "Noetherian", "target_term": "诺特"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "引理中给定的映射。"}, {"source_term": "Noetherian", "target_term": "诺特", "context": "条件中由括号标出局部版本的性质。"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型", "context": "条件中由括号标出局部版本的有限性性质。"}, {"source_term": "Noetherian", "target_term": "诺特", "context": "结论中对应的性质。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01T6:proof", "translation": "由于诺特环（Noetherian ring）上的有限型（finite type）环（ring）是诺特（Noetherian）的，结论立即成立。见《代数（Algebra）》中的引理<REF_0001>。（另外，利用如下事实：若一个拟紧（quasi-compact）态射（morphism）的目标（target）是拟紧（quasi-compact）的，则其源（source）也是拟紧（quasi-compact）的。）\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "Noetherian ring", "target_term": "诺特环"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "Noetherian", "target_term": "诺特"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "target", "target_term": "目标"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}, {"source_term": "source", "target_term": "源"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "Noetherian ring", "target_term": "诺特环", "context": "所用代数事实中的基环。"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型", "context": "所用代数事实中的有限性条件。"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环", "context": "所用代数事实中的上方环。"}, {"source_term": "Noetherian", "target_term": "诺特", "context": "所用代数事实给出的环的性质。"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "被引用的章节名称。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧", "context": "括号内态射的性质。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "括号内考虑的映射。"}, {"source_term": "target", "target_term": "目标", "context": "态射所指向的对象。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧", "context": "括号内对目标的条件。"}, {"source_term": "source", "target_term": "源", "context": "态射从中出发的对象。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧", "context": "括号内对源所得的结论。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01T7:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是局部有限型（locally of finite type）的，且<MATH_0002>是局部诺特（locally Noetherian）的。则<MATH_0003>是拟分离（quasi-separated）的。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型"}, {"source_term": "locally Noetherian", "target_term": "局部诺特"}, {"source_term": "quasi-separated", "target_term": "拟分离"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型", "context": "引理中的有限性假设。"}, {"source_term": "locally Noetherian", "target_term": "局部诺特", "context": "引理中的诺特性假设。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-separated", "target_term": "拟分离", "context": "引理所断言的性质。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01T7:proof", "translation": "事实上，<MATH_0001>是拟分离（quasi-separated）的，见《性质（Properties）》中的引理<REF_0001>以及上文的引理<REF_0002>。再应用《概形（Schemes）》中的引理<REF_0003>，可知<MATH_0002>是拟分离（quasi-separated）的。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "quasi-separated", "target_term": "拟分离"}, {"source_term": "Properties", "target_term": "性质"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "quasi-separated", "target_term": "拟分离"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "quasi-separated", "target_term": "拟分离", "context": "证明首先指出的性质。"}, {"source_term": "Properties", "target_term": "性质", "context": "第一个引用所指的章节名称。"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "最后一个引用所指的章节名称。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-separated", "target_term": "拟分离", "context": "应用最后一个引理得到的性质。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01T8:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是基概形（base scheme）<MATH_0002>上的概形（schemes）之间的态射（morphism）。若<MATH_0003>在<MATH_0004>上是局部有限型（locally of finite type）的，则<MATH_0005>是局部有限型（locally of finite type）的。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "base scheme", "target_term": "基概形"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "base scheme", "target_term": "基概形", "context": "引理中作为共同基底的概形。"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "给定态射两端的概形。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "引理中给定的映射。"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型", "context": "引理假设的性质。"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型", "context": "引理推出的性质。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01T8:proof", "translation": "由引理<REF_0001>，这可化为如下代数（algebra）事实：给定环同态（ring maps）<MATH_0001>，若<MATH_0002>是有限型（finite type）的，则<MATH_0003>是有限型（finite type）的。（见《代数（Algebra）》中的引理<REF_0002>。）\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "ring maps", "target_term": "环同态"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "所归结到的事实所属领域。"}, {"source_term": "ring maps", "target_term": "环同态", "context": "该代数事实中给定的映射。"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型", "context": "该代数事实中的假设。"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型", "context": "该代数事实中的结论。"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "被引用的章节名称。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01T9:title", "translation": "有限型（finite type）的点（Points）与雅各布森（Jacobson）概形（schemes）", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}, {"source_term": "Points", "target_term": "点"}, {"source_term": "Jacobson", "target_term": "雅各布森"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型", "context": "标题中修饰点的性质。"}, {"source_term": "Points", "target_term": "点", "context": "标题先讨论的对象。"}, {"source_term": "Jacobson", "target_term": "雅各布森", "context": "标题中修饰概形的性质。"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "标题后讨论的对象。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01T9:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n设<MATH_0001>是一个概形（scheme）。有限型点（finite type point）<MATH_0002>是<MATH_0003>中满足下列条件的点（point）：态射（morphism）<MATH_0004>是有限型（finite type）的。\n研究这一概念的原因是，有限型点（finite type points）在某种意义上、在某些情形下可以代替闭点（closed points）。例如，它们总是足够多的。此外，一个概形（scheme）是雅各布森（Jacobson）的，当且仅当其所有有限型点（finite type points）都是闭点（closed points）。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "finite type point", "target_term": "有限型点"}, {"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}, {"source_term": "finite type points", "target_term": "有限型点"}, {"source_term": "closed points", "target_term": "闭点"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "Jacobson", "target_term": "雅各布森"}, {"source_term": "finite type points", "target_term": "有限型点"}, {"source_term": "closed points", "target_term": "闭点"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "段首给定的几何对象。"}, {"source_term": "finite type point", "target_term": "有限型点", "context": "句中所定义的点。"}, {"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点", "context": "定义中受有限型条件限定的对象。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "定义中须满足有限型条件的映射。"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型", "context": "定义中要求态射满足的性质。"}, {"source_term": "finite type points", "target_term": "有限型点", "context": "讨论中可以代替闭点的对象。"}, {"source_term": "closed points", "target_term": "闭点", "context": "讨论中在特定情形下可由有限型点代替的对象。"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "最后一句中讨论其性质的对象。"}, {"source_term": "Jacobson", "target_term": "雅各布森", "context": "最后一句所刻画的概形性质。"}, {"source_term": "finite type points", "target_term": "有限型点", "context": "最后一句判别条件量化的对象。"}, {"source_term": "closed points", "target_term": "闭点", "context": "最后一句要求有限型点具有的性质。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01TA:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是一个概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>是一个域（field）。设<MATH_0003>是一个态射（morphism）。下列条件等价（equivalent）：\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 态射（morphism）<MATH_0004>是有限型（finite type）的。\n<STRUCT_0003> 态射（morphism）<MATH_0005>是局部有限型（locally of finite type）的。\n<STRUCT_0004> 存在一个仿射开集（affine open）<MATH_0006>，它位于<MATH_0007>中，且<MATH_0008>对应于有限环同态（finite ring map）<MATH_0009>。\n<STRUCT_0005> 存在一个仿射开集（affine open）<MATH_0010>，它位于<MATH_0011>中，使得<MATH_0012>的像（image）恰由一个闭点（closed point）<MATH_0013>组成，该点位于<MATH_0014>中，且域（field）扩张（extension）<MATH_0015>是有限（finite）的。\n<STRUCT_0006>\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "finite ring map", "target_term": "有限环同态"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像"}, {"source_term": "closed point", "target_term": "闭点"}, {"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域"}, {"source_term": "extension", "target_term": "扩张"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "引理中给定的几何对象。"}, {"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域", "context": "引理中给定的代数对象。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "引理中给定的映射。"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价", "context": "四个条件之间的逻辑关系。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "第一项中检查的映射。"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型", "context": "第一项所要求的性质。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "第二项中检查的映射。"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型", "context": "第二项所要求的性质。"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集", "context": "第三项中要求存在的开集。"}, {"source_term": "finite ring map", "target_term": "有限环同态", "context": "第三项中对应的环同态。"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集", "context": "第四项中要求存在的开集。"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像", "context": "第四项中要求恰由一个闭点组成的集合。"}, {"source_term": "closed point", "target_term": "闭点", "context": "第四项中像所含的唯一的点。"}, {"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域", "context": "第四项中扩张所涉及的代数对象。"}, {"source_term": "extension", "target_term": "扩张", "context": "第四项中须为有限的域扩张。"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限", "context": "第四项所要求的域扩张性质。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01TA:proof", "translation": "（1）与（2）的等价性（equivalence）是显然的，因为<MATH_0001>是单点集（singleton），故从它出发的任一态射（morphism）都是拟紧（quasi-compact）的。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n假设<MATH_0002>是局部有限型（locally of finite type）的。任取一个仿射开集（affine open）<MATH_0003>，使得<MATH_0004>的像（image）包含于<MATH_0005>中，且环同态（ring map）<MATH_0006>是有限型（finite type）的。设<MATH_0007>为其核（kernel）。则<MATH_0008>是有限型（finite type）的。由《代数（Algebra）》中的引理<REF_0001>，存在<MATH_0009>，使得<MATH_0010>是一个域（field），且<MATH_0011>是有限（finite）的域（field）扩张（extension）。若<MATH_0012>是<MATH_0013>的一个提升（lift），则可知<MATH_0014>是一个有限（finite）的<MATH_0015>-模（module）。故（2）<MATH_0016>（3）。\n\n<STRUCT_0003><STRUCT_0004>\n假设<MATH_0017>是一个仿射开集（affine open），使得<MATH_0018>对应于有限环同态（finite ring map）<MATH_0019>。则<MATH_0020>是局部有限型（locally of finite type）的，这是由引理<REF_0002>得出的。故（3）<MATH_0021>（2）。\n\n<STRUCT_0005><STRUCT_0006>\n假设<MATH_0022>是有限（finite）的。<MATH_0023>的像（image）是一个域（field），且<MATH_0024>在该域上是有限（finite）的，这由《代数（Algebra）》中的引理<REF_0003>得出。因此，<MATH_0025>的核（kernel）是极大（maximal）理想（ideal）。故（3）<MATH_0026>（4）。\n\n<STRUCT_0007><STRUCT_0008>\n蕴含（implication）（4）<MATH_0027>（3）直接成立。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "equivalence", "target_term": "等价性"}, {"source_term": "singleton", "target_term": "单点集"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像"}, {"source_term": "ring map", "target_term": "环同态"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}, {"source_term": "kernel", "target_term": "核"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域"}, {"source_term": "extension", "target_term": "扩张"}, {"source_term": "lift", "target_term": "提升"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "finite ring map", "target_term": "有限环同态"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像"}, {"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "kernel", "target_term": "核"}, {"source_term": "maximal", "target_term": "极大"}, {"source_term": "ideal", "target_term": "理想"}, {"source_term": "implication", "target_term": "蕴含"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "equivalence", "target_term": "等价性", "context": "证明开头讨论的第一项和第二项之间的关系。"}, {"source_term": "singleton", "target_term": "单点集", "context": "用来推出所述态射拟紧的性质。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "从该单点集出发的映射。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧", "context": "任一上述态射的性质。"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型", "context": "从第二项推出第三项时采用的假设。"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集", "context": "满足所列条件而任取的开集。"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像", "context": "须包含在指定开集中的集合。"}, {"source_term": "ring map", "target_term": "环同态", "context": "由所取开集得到的映射。"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型", "context": "所取开集必须使相应环同态满足的性质。"}, {"source_term": "kernel", "target_term": "核", "context": "前述环同态的核。"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型", "context": "引出代数引理前得到的性质。"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "关于域扩张的引理所在章节。"}, {"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域", "context": "引用引理所得的代数对象。"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限", "context": "引用引理所给出的域扩张性质。"}, {"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域", "context": "该扩张所涉及的代数对象。"}, {"source_term": "extension", "target_term": "扩张", "context": "引用引理所得的域扩张。"}, {"source_term": "lift", "target_term": "提升", "context": "为得到模的有限性而取的提升。"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限", "context": "从提升得出的模的性质。"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "第二项推出第三项时被证明有限的对象。"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集", "context": "从第三项推出第二项时所取的开集。"}, {"source_term": "finite ring map", "target_term": "有限环同态", "context": "由第三项假设得到的环同态。"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型", "context": "从第三项推出第二项时得到的性质。"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限", "context": "从第三项推出第四项所用的假设。"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像", "context": "在此处被证明是域的集合。"}, {"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域", "context": "此处所述的像的代数性质。"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限", "context": "在这个像域上的有限性结论。"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "有关像域与有限性的引理所在章节。"}, {"source_term": "kernel", "target_term": "核", "context": "从第三项推出第四项时考察的核。"}, {"source_term": "maximal", "target_term": "极大", "context": "此处由像为域得出的理想性质。"}, {"source_term": "ideal", "target_term": "理想", "context": "此处视为极大理想的核。"}, {"source_term": "implication", "target_term": "蕴含", "context": "证明最后从第四项到第三项的逻辑关系。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:02HV:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是一个概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>是一个阿廷（Artinian）局部环（local ring），其剩余域（residue field）为<MATH_0003>。设<MATH_0004>是概形（schemes）之间的态射（morphism）。则<MATH_0005>是有限型（finite type）的，当且仅当复合（composition）<MATH_0006>是有限型（finite type）的。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "Artinian", "target_term": "阿廷"}, {"source_term": "local ring", "target_term": "局部环"}, {"source_term": "residue field", "target_term": "剩余域"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}, {"source_term": "composition", "target_term": "复合"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "引理中给定的几何对象。"}, {"source_term": "Artinian", "target_term": "阿廷", "context": "引理中对局部环施加的性质。"}, {"source_term": "local ring", "target_term": "局部环", "context": "引理中给定的代数对象。"}, {"source_term": "residue field", "target_term": "剩余域", "context": "给定局部环的剩余域。"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "给定态射两端的概形。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "引理中给定的映射。"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型", "context": "等价陈述左侧的性质。"}, {"source_term": "composition", "target_term": "复合", "context": "等价陈述右侧考察的复合。"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型", "context": "等价陈述右侧的性质。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:02HV:proof", "translation": "由于态射（morphism）<MATH_0001>是有限型的，显然若<MATH_0002>是有限型（finite type）的，则复合（composition）<MATH_0003>也是有限型（finite type）的（见引理<REF_0001>）。\n反之，注意到<MATH_0004>映射（maps）到某个仿射开集（affine open）<MATH_0005>中，该开集位于<MATH_0006>中。这是因为<MATH_0007>只有一个点（point）。最后，将《代数（Algebra）》中的引理<REF_0002>应用于<MATH_0008>即可。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}, {"source_term": "composition", "target_term": "复合"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "正向证明首先指出其性质的映射。"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型", "context": "正向证明首先利用的性质，原文在词组内换行。"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型", "context": "正向证明的假设。"}, {"source_term": "composition", "target_term": "复合", "context": "正向证明中推出其有限型性质的复合。"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型", "context": "正向证明的结论。"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "逆向证明中说明映射的像落在某开集中。"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集", "context": "逆向证明中容纳映射的像的开集。"}, {"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点", "context": "用来说明所述对象只有一个点。"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "证明最后应用的引理所在章节。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01T9:prose-0002", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n回顾一下，若点（point）<MATH_0001>位于概形（scheme）<MATH_0002>中，则有一个典范态射（canonical morphism）<MATH_0003>。见《概形（Schemes）》第<REF_0001>节。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "canonical morphism", "target_term": "典范态射"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点", "context": "用以确定典范态射的点。"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "所给点所属的概形。"}, {"source_term": "canonical morphism", "target_term": "典范态射", "context": "由所给点确定的态射。"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "被引用的章节名称。"}], "notes": []}
